//www.tradingview.com/pine-script-docs/concepts/timeframes/#timeframe-string-specifications).","basis":"official_translation","translation_provenance":{"status":"verified_official","sources":[{"language":"en","url":"https://static.tradingview.com/static/bundles/en.66605.ffbf515d2b64e3dc7753.js","sha256":"480a3c2f481380bda24a3ad98198c0282ee652fe9903b09181dcec852c4db43d","message_id":421128,"export_indexes":[0],"export_text_sha256":"cd3533c9d66de5f010c357054b3c05e4f781836f31de93e14339dbb2a2c6d444"},{"language":"ru","url":"https://static.tradingview.com/static/bundles/ru.66605.ffbf515d2b64e3dc7753.js","sha256":"1a66cb92a1d0de041caee79ad854183414b05fc53b26c308028ef523106df3dd","message_id":421128,"export_indexes":[0],"export_text_sha256":"b72f4f72d9b3e4407dcdef937b6099795aebf3c331f39cd5535f6e53b2ea805c"}],"match":"byte_exact_rendered_EN_and_RU_pair","original_sha256":"2fa5be8eaf2ef066bf5a7d88bd6a40b6402873d36beeb0715e58a04acf2b5fb3","source_ru_sha256":"760c61767452b807c4fce2e692e091e265b3b838038adcb4ec977afd2e1008b3"}},"bd36e8427c262bfb":{"ru":"Если для заданного количества секунд не существует допустимого временного интервала, то будет возвращён следующий по значению интервал. Соответственно, при значении 1 секунда или меньше будет возвращён секундный интервал, при значении 2-5 секунд — 5-секундный, а при значении 604 799 секунд (одна секунда меньше 7 дней) — 7-дневный.\n\nЕсли секунды точно представляют два или более действительных временных интервалов, то будет использован тот из них, который имеет бóльшую базовую единицу. Таким образом, 604 800 секунд (7 дней) возвращают \"1Н\", а не \"7Д\".\n\nВсе значения выше 31,622,400 (366 дней) возвращают \"12Мес\"","en":"If no valid timeframe exists for the quantity of seconds supplied, the next higher valid timeframe will be returned. Accordingly, one second or less will return \"1S\", 2-5 seconds will return \"5S\", and 604,799 seconds (one second less than 7 days) will return \"7D\".\n\nIf the seconds exactly represent two or more valid timeframes, the one with the larger base unit will be used. Thus 604,800 seconds (7 days) returns \"1W\", not \"7D\".\n\nAll values above 31,622,400 (366 days) return \"12M\".","original":"If no valid timeframe exists for the quantity of seconds supplied, the next higher valid timeframe will be returned. Accordingly, one second or less will return \"1S\", 2-5 seconds will return \"5S\", and 604,799 seconds (one second less than 7 days) will return \"7D\".\n\nIf the seconds exactly represent two or more valid timeframes, the one with the larger base unit will be used. Thus 604,800 seconds (7 days) returns \"1W\", not \"7D\".\n\nAll values above 31,622,400 (366 days) return \"12M\".","basis":"official_translation","translation_provenance":{"status":"verified_official","sources":[{"language":"en","url":"https://static.tradingview.com/static/bundles/en.66605.ffbf515d2b64e3dc7753.js","sha256":"480a3c2f481380bda24a3ad98198c0282ee652fe9903b09181dcec852c4db43d","message_id":700936,"export_indexes":[0],"export_text_sha256":"0b328b5a91d244fd3284f401a8cf8d7d34bb85101c6cd0002d235967e410b681"},{"language":"ru","url":"https://static.tradingview.com/static/bundles/ru.66605.ffbf515d2b64e3dc7753.js","sha256":"1a66cb92a1d0de041caee79ad854183414b05fc53b26c308028ef523106df3dd","message_id":700936,"export_indexes":[0],"export_text_sha256":"d29a899d13c6a7cfb291e86b618fafcf92eebedab7f0e1245076f566ee4545fe"},{"language":"en","url":"https://static.tradingview.com/static/bundles/en.66605.ffbf515d2b64e3dc7753.js","sha256":"480a3c2f481380bda24a3ad98198c0282ee652fe9903b09181dcec852c4db43d","message_id":37236,"export_indexes":[0],"export_text_sha256":"b12431ab804880abc1eeba37c4c0a69fddc9e0d6fbfa48404ba8f6a2766919e4"},{"language":"ru","url":"https://static.tradingview.com/static/bundles/ru.66605.ffbf515d2b64e3dc7753.js","sha256":"1a66cb92a1d0de041caee79ad854183414b05fc53b26c308028ef523106df3dd","message_id":37236,"export_indexes":[0],"export_text_sha256":"3121b40ff9ac834ffdaf0cb66d